  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Platform for Gender Based Violence Prevention and Response in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of this project is to raise awareness about, and improve response to, Gender Based Violence in Nepal. This will be achieved by improving the quality and reach of services for GBV survivors through a helpline, promoting greater awareness among key stakeholders and strengthening the capacity of National Women Commission (NWC).</narrative>
  </description>
